==Battleground==
*2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Yuki (Enemy)|Yuki]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Good Cats, Bad Cats is a reference to "[https://youtu.be/c9hg-JEDPko GOOD NEWS, BAD NEWS]", stage 4-4-2 of [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event|Shoumetsu Toshi]].

